WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.304
- We're taking this red
carpet very seriously.

00:00:02.304 --> 00:00:04.591
- That's why we're asking everyone to--

00:00:05.041 --> 00:00:08.016
We're at the world premiere of
Star Wars: The Force Awakens

00:00:08.016 --> 00:00:10.303
in Hollywood, and we're
getting celebrities

00:00:10.303 --> 00:00:12.690
to do their best Star Wars impressions.

00:00:13.101 --> 00:00:15.504
(imitates Chewbacca)

00:00:15.504 --> 00:00:16.636
That was Chewbacca.

00:00:16.636 --> 00:00:21.516
(bouncy big-band music)

00:00:22.126 --> 00:00:23.741
So let's start off with something easy.

00:00:23.741 --> 00:00:25.652
Can you do a Chewbacca impression?

00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:27.101
(groans like Chewbacca)

00:00:27.101 --> 00:00:28.320
- Bad. Bad.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.641
- I need a really loud one.

00:00:29.641 --> 00:00:31.248
- No, you're only trying to embarrass me

00:00:31.248 --> 00:00:32.862
in front of Max von Sydow!

00:00:32.862 --> 00:00:33.999
(groans like Chewbacca)

00:00:33.999 --> 00:00:36.220
(hoots like Chewbacca)

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:41.128
(hoots like Chewbacca)

00:00:41.128 --> 00:00:43.009
- We're asking everyone do
to their best impressions

00:00:43.009 --> 00:00:44.251
of other characters.

00:00:44.251 --> 00:00:45.842
So can we get a Chewbacca roar from--

00:00:46.892 --> 00:00:48.553
- No Chewbacca roar?

00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:52.309
(warbles like Chewbacca)

00:00:52.309 --> 00:00:55.942
- (groans) Wait. (groans) Eh.

00:00:55.942 --> 00:00:57.028
- That's embarrassing.

00:00:57.028 --> 00:00:58.066
- OK, Mark said--

00:00:58.066 --> 00:00:58.784
(groans)

00:00:58.784 --> 00:00:59.443
- That was great!

00:00:59.443 --> 00:01:00.048
- That was it.

00:01:00.048 --> 00:01:01.271
- Can we get a little bit louder?

00:01:01.271 --> 00:01:02.487
(groans)

00:01:02.487 --> 00:01:03.852
- A plus, thanks Carrie!

00:01:03.852 --> 00:01:06.482
- I'll do it with you. If we
do it together, will you do it?

00:01:06.482 --> 00:01:08.327
(moans)

00:01:11.197 --> 00:01:13.334
- Harrison told me mine was
awful, can you do better--

00:01:14.114 --> 00:01:15.877
(moans)

00:01:17.017 --> 00:01:18.570
- Thank you! Yes!

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.326
- Luke liked it, Han Solo hated
it, you guys have to decide.

00:01:22.326 --> 00:01:24.628
- Do you think you can
do an R2D2 beep for us?

00:01:24.628 --> 00:01:25.611
- OK cool.

00:01:25.681 --> 00:01:28.657
(beeps and trills)

00:01:28.657 --> 00:01:30.180
(beeps)

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:30.935
- Beep beep beep.

00:01:30.935 --> 00:01:32.641
- Boop, boop boop boop, boop.

00:01:32.641 --> 00:01:34.729
- How about an R2D2 beep?

00:01:35.819 --> 00:01:36.600
- Beep.

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:38.191
- Pretty solid.

00:01:38.191 --> 00:01:38.725
- Sure.

00:01:38.725 --> 00:01:39.467
- All right.

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:40.666
- Boo dip dip. Bip bip.

00:01:40.666 --> 00:01:43.137
I don't know, and now I'm
getting confused with BB-8.

00:01:43.137 --> 00:01:44.484
What does R2 sound like?

00:01:44.484 --> 00:01:45.749
Beep beep boop boop, beep.

00:01:45.749 --> 00:01:47.355
- Yeah, you probably just like cursed

00:01:47.355 --> 00:01:49.035
in R2D2 or something.

00:01:49.035 --> 00:01:50.161
How about a light saber noise?

00:01:50.161 --> 00:01:51.026
(buzzes)

00:01:51.026 --> 00:01:55.159
(whooshes and buzzes)

00:01:55.166 --> 00:01:56.709
- I don't know (whooshes).

00:01:56.709 --> 00:01:58.114
- Pretty solid, I think you nailed it.

00:01:58.114 --> 00:02:02.131
(buzzes and whooshes)

00:02:02.131 --> 00:02:04.708
(buzzes)

00:02:04.708 --> 00:02:07.251
(hums)

00:02:07.251 --> 00:02:08.296
(whooshes)

00:02:09.326 --> 00:02:10.286
- Thank you.

00:02:10.676 --> 00:02:12.123
- Nice talking to you.

00:02:12.253 --> 00:02:13.140
- Mew mew mew!

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:13.970
- All right, that--

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:14.837
Oh no, that's the planes!

00:02:14.837 --> 00:02:15.955
- That's like more the ship.

00:02:15.955 --> 00:02:18.796
- Oh I love those ones, because
I always go nerd nerd nerd!

00:02:18.796 --> 00:02:20.205
- Mr. Stormtrooper!

00:02:20.655 --> 00:02:21.575
Yes.

00:02:21.895 --> 00:02:23.757
A word, could I have a word?

